@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
participant "Delivery worker" as W
participant "Gateway" as G
participant "Laptop (cursor 1240)" as D
participant "Sync service" as Y
W -> G : push seq 1241
G -x D : frame lost (half-open socket)
note over W : The worker commits its offset:\ndelivery is best-effort
note over D : Nothing follows 1241, so there is no\ngap to see. The laptop looks up to date
... up to 5 minutes later ...
D -> G : HEAD_CHECK {lastSyncTs} (with a heartbeat)
G -> Y : which conversations changed?
Y --> D : 9001: head = 1241
D -> Y : SYNC {9001: 1240}
Y --> D : MSG 1241
D --> Y : DELIVERED up to 1241
note over D, Y : Gap detection repairs a hole with a later message after it.\nThe periodic head check repairs the last message, which has none.
@enduml
